      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這件事讓我越想越開心，\n於是決定要獨自來舉辦大賽了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n賽事的名稱就叫……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
